  "title": "Giving Back Close to Home: What I Learned Volunteering at the Billerica Community Pantry",
  "summary": "Some of the most meaningful community impact doesn't happen in a manufacturing facility. Sometimes it happens on a Monday morning, unpacking boxes of fresh produce alongside coworkers while preparing food for local families. Recently, I had the opportunity to volunteer at the Billerica Community Pantry with a group of employees from our site in Bedford, Massachusetts. The experience left a lasting impression on me, not only because of the important work being done there, but because it reminded me of the value of investing in the communities around us.",
